e players qualify: first those who cleared their board, in order of completion, then those who opened the most of it. Boards and mine counts grow over three qualifying rounds, until four players compete for the podium in the final. Bots fill any empty seats. The game also includes a solo practice mode, private rooms, ranked points and cosmetic items.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/boomboombattle", "videos": [{"id": 202661, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "02EMc8YFpxc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=02EMc8YFpxc", "title": "Le d\u00e9mineur en \u00e9limination directe : 32 joueurs, un seul vainqueur \ud83d\udca3", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/02EMc8YFpxc/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "game_localizations": [{"id": 63914, "region": {"id": 4, "name": "Europe", "category": "continent", "identifier": "EU"}}]}